The pre-fix source incorrectly asserted inport_last_i on the final payload word. jpeg_input.v treats last as a one-byte terminal marker, so this run discarded the last three payload lanes. This is a harness stimulus error, not a production-core failure.

Captured pre-fix VVP stop:
